  "subdivision_of_building": "Ground floor/part first floor -  Commercial unit\nsecond and third floors - Office space ",
  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "New shopfront and signage / advertisement",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm\">The proposal fails to demonstrate\r\na design-led response to the site and would result in a shopfront and signage\r\nthat are visually intrusive and unsympathetic to the architectural character of\r\nthe locally listed building. The proposal fails to&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\">conserve or enhance the significance of the\r\nheritage asset,<font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"1\">&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\">introduces excessive and poorly integrated\r\nsignage and<font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"1\">&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\">does not respond positively to local character\r\nor context. The proposal is contrary </span>Policies D12.3, D12.4, D12.5 and D12.7, and the\r\nCouncil’s adopted Shopfront Design Guidance (2017).</p>"
  ],
